            <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
              <name>DateOfDeduction</name>
              <id>299</id>
              <visible>true</visible>
              <enabled>true</enabled>
              <userVisible>
                <common>true</common>
              </userVisible>
              <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
                <segments>Object.DateOfDeduction</segments>
              </dataPath>
              <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
              <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
              <extendedTooltip>
                <name>DateOfDeductionExtendedTooltip</name>
                <id>361</id>
                <title>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Mode &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>document&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> is used for planned write-off.
Mode &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>previous&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> is used for previous write-off and the following depreciation adjustment.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>حالت &lt;b>از&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>تاریخ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>سند&lt;/> برای اسقاط برنامه‌ریزی‌شده استفاده می‌شود.
حالت &lt;b>از&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>تاریخ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>قبلی&lt;/> برای اسقاط قبلی و تعدیل بعدی استهلاک استفاده می‌شود.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Modalità&lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>di data&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>del documento&lt;/> utilizzata per la modifica dei parametri nell'ordine pianificato.
Modalità &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>data&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>precedente&lt;/> utilizzata per la correzione dei parametri nel passato e per la correzione successiva dell'ammortamento.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Tryb &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>daty&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dokumentu&lt;/> jest używany do planowanego rozchodu.
Tryb &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>poprzedniej&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>daty&lt;/> jest używany do rozchodu w przeszłości i do następnej korekty amortyzacji.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Режим &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>даты&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>документа&lt;/> используется для списания в плановом порядке.
Режим &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>прошлой&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>даты&lt;/> используется для списания в прошлом и для последующей корректировки амортизации.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Belge &lt;b>tarihi &lt;/>&lt;b>modu, &lt;/>&lt;b>parametreleri&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> planlı &lt;/>olarak değiştirmek için kullanılır. Geçmiş 
tarih&lt;b> modu, &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>geçmişteki &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>parametreleri &lt;/>düzeltmek ve sonraki amortisman ayarlamaları için kullanılır.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Chế độ &lt;b>Từ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ngày&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>chứng từ&lt;/> được dùng để ghi giảm theo trình tự dự tính.
Chế độ &lt;b>Từ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ngày&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>trước&lt;/> được dùng để ghi giảm vào ngày quá khứ và điều chỉnh khấu hao sau này.
</value>
                </title>
                <formatted>true</formatted>
                <type>Label</type>
                <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                  <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                </extInfo>
